or Photo Mode, t-shirts for Chai, Photo Mode stickers, extra outfits and even Special Attacks starring CNMN and Smidge, everybody's favorite mechanical friends.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Start with a bang!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1817230/6a17ae85136a300ef7a18fe7b6bcb75c9303c18f.jpg"},{"name":"Cream of the Crop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1817230/42decc9bd99525b55035670913013484cf8d011c.jpg"},{"name":"This will cost you big time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1817230/3855d4a7500ebadcc8570186fa9fd159bdc83d34.jpg"},{"name":"The Negotiator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1817230/d6c3c70419f78db7af45935f01c56b3023ec9c16.jpg"},{"name":"Headliner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1817230/bdff3782cf737c7b917acebddd1a2b9ae8ed4c30.jpg"},{"name":"Time to pay up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1817230/8a53394c221ac7263d6e3fefb7f8c3107e5a3232.jpg"},{"name":"Who's the boss now?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1817230/cc7c41caceddc8096ea069c7a17382aca8e342a7.jpg"},{"name":"Easy Listening","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1817230/3cde76186db7fd7adcff13ccc0c7dc65152480d5.jpg"},{"name":"Well that was a rush!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1817230/958d0bdc83b5a2c9662b95507c1b39105a08b2b7.jpg"},{"name":"I think I deserve some praise, here!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1817230/b622f3e3d810e20709a07bbf8937ed51c890d890.jpg"}],"total":71},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1817230?t=1764916407","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817230/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764916407","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817230/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764916407","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817230/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764916407","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817230/extras/1f8c88b72c2c2762e1a9a15ff23988fc.avif?t=1764916407\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Included in the Hi-Fi RUSH Deluxe Edition:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi-Fi RUSH (Base game) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Chai outfits* </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven bonus Chai t-shirts </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >808-Themed Guitar Skin </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >808 Alternate Skin </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gears Starter Pack with 20,000 Gears for unlocking combat skills and other upgrades. (Note: Gears are obtained through combat and exploration in-game and not available as a purchasable currency.) </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Each of the Chai Outfits includes an alternate robot arm, scarf, jacket, trousers and shoes which can be mixed and matched with the other cosmetics in-game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Gears are immediately available after purchase. Players get access to the other items after beating the opening stage and can change their outfits in the Hideout.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Feel the beat as wannabe rockstar Chai and his ragtag team of allies rebel against an evil robotics enhancement megacorp with raucous rhythm combat! From Tango Gameworks, the studio that brought you The Evil Within\u00ae and Ghostwire\u00ae:Tokyo  (no, really) comes Hi-Fi RUSH, an all-new action game where the characters, world and combat stylishly sync to the music! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817230/extras/10fb13ad0b80325e067c192057976824.poster.avif?t=1764916407\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817230/extras/10fb13ad0b80325e067c192057976824.webm?t=1764916407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817230/extras/10fb13ad0b80325e067c192057976824.mp4?t=1764916407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817230/extras/22aa908edc4eba5d074c0c1f3f575e4d.poster.avif?t=1764916407\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817230/extras/22aa908edc4eba5d074c0c1f3f575e4d.webm?t=1764916407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817230/extras/22aa908edc4eba5d074c0c1f3f575e4d.mp4?t=17649164