! Tower Up! is a twist on the Rhythm Tower mode that players unlock after their first playthrough. You\u2019ll be climbing up floors and defeating waves of enemies, but this time you\u2019ll be powering up a downgraded Chai with randomized Upgrades! <br><br>The Arcade Challenge! Update!  also contains additional content for players to earn through challenges and discover in-game, including poses for Photo Mode, t-shirts for Chai, Photo Mode stickers, extra outfits and even Special Attacks starring CNMN and Smidge, everybody's favorite mechanical friends.","developers":["Tango Gameworks"],"dlc":[2076280,2341310,2314670,2314700,2365950,2627290],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817230/header.jpg?t=1764916407","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Hi-Fi RUSH \u00a9 2023 KRAFTON, Inc. All Rights Reserved. Developed by Tango Gameworks. Hi-Fi RUSH is a trademark or a registered trademark of KRAFTON, Inc., in the U.S. and other countries.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"metacritic":{"score":90,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/hi-fi-rush?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1817230/1666817001/b4923fadd44dd5642228e85bc522ac6f739a781e/1762755913/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763072078","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1817230/1666817001/b4923fadd44dd5642228e85bc522ac6f739a781e/1762755913/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763072078","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1817230/1666817001/b4923fadd44dd5642228e85bc522ac6f739a781e/1762755913/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763072078","id":25722899